-- prompt.md --
Implement `transpose(matrix)` and `rotate_clockwise(matrix)` in `grid/rotate.py`.

A matrix is a list of rows, each a list; it may be rectangular rather than square. Both functions return a new matrix (lists of lists) and leave the input unchanged. `[]` gives `[]`. Rows of different lengths raise `ValueError`.
